            "fill": "transparent",
            "stroke": "transparent",
            "strokeWidth": 0,
            "text": "Third-party component management is partially addressed by Dependabot, but a more comprehensive SCA program is needed\na)     Dependabot opens dependency update PRs, helping surface outdated packages and providing developers with a path to remediate common dependency issues. Formal SCA governance would help prioritize high-risk vulnerabilities, document accepted exceptions, and track remediation across the application portfolio",
